---
// Quiz figure for Post 7: Cyclical commodity stock across Boom Peak vs Recession Trough.
---
<div class="qfig-sbq07cyc">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 185" role="img" aria-label="Steel stock metrics across Boom Peak (Price 45,000, BVPS 20,000, EPS 10,000, P/E 4.5x, P/B 2.25x) vs Trough (Price 16,000, BVPS 20,000, EPS 500, P/E 32x, P/B 0.80x).">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Cyclical Steelmaker: Cycle Peak vs Cycle Trough (BVPS = 20,000 đ)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Doanh nghiệp thép: Đỉnh chu kỳ vs Đáy chu kỳ (BVPS = 20.000 đ)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="44" width="262" height="124" rx="8" class="qfig-card-red" />
    <text x="32" y="72" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Year 1: Boom Peak</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Năm 1: Đỉnh chu kỳ sốt giá</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="100">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Price: 45,000 đ | EPS: 10,000 đ</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thị giá: 45.000 đ | EPS: 10.000 đ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="126" class="qfig-t qfig-red">P/E = 4.5× | P/B = 2.25×</text>
    <text x="32" y="152" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Temporary 50% peak ROE</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>ROE đỉnh tạm thời tới 50%</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="302" y="44" width="262" height="124" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="318" y="72" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Year 3: Recession Trough</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Năm 3: Đáy suy giảm ngành</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="100">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Price: 16,000 đ | EPS: 500 đ</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thị giá: 16.000 đ | EPS: 500 đ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="126" class="qfig-t">P/E = 32.0× | P/B = 0.80×</text>
    <text x="318" y="152" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Assets sit 20% below book</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thị giá rẻ hơn sổ sách 20%</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq07cyc { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq07cyc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq07cyc text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq07cyc .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq07cyc .qfig-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq07cyc .qfig-m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-sbq07cyc .qfig-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-sbq07cyc .qfig-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-sbq07cyc .qfig-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
</style>
